# Gripper force command.
# Field unit is Newton (gripper is a prismatic joint; sign maps to direction).
#   force > 0   → close direction (GRIP, hardware fires CmdID 0x0004 with GRIP)
#   force < 0   → open direction (RELEASE)
#   force = 0   → STOP
# 上位机 clamp 到 [-gripper_max_torque_, +gripper_max_torque_] (controller_params yaml).
# 字段历史叫 torque (字段名误导, 实际是 N), 现统一改名.
float64 force
---
bool success
string message
